Subject: [PATCH v5 10/11] x86/vsyscall/64: Add ENDBR64 to vsyscall entry points
Date:   Thu, 11 Oct 2018 08:16:53 -0700
Message-Id: <20181011151654.27221-11-yu-cheng.yu@intel.com>
